    "objective": "Repair TimestampSigner age validation: when max_age is supplied, a signature dated after the verifier clock must raise SignatureExpired and preserve payload/date_signed metadata. Preserve ordinary validity, expiry boundaries, signature checks, return_timestamp and the existing max_age=None behavior. All keys, clocks and values in this case are synthetic; do not change the clock or signing algorithm.",
    "public_log": "AssertionError: TimestampSigner accepted a validly signed synthetic value when the verification clock was one second earlier than its signed timestamp, despite max_age=60. Expected SignatureExpired. No external service or real credentials are involved.",
